        "items": [
          {
            "text": "Raymond James' Private Wealth Advisor designation program targets advisors who specialize in high-net-worth clients, which the firm generally defines as those with at least $5 million in investable assets.",
            "quote": "the firm's Raymond James Private Wealth Advisor designation program, launched in September 2022, which provides training, coaching, and a peer network for advisors who specialize in high-net-worth clients - generally defined as those with at least $5 million in investable assets",
            "value": "5 million",
            "unit": "USD investable assets",
            "period": "",
            "scope": "",
            "definition": "high-net-worth clients - generally defined as those with at least $5 million in investable assets",
            "chunk_ids": [
              "RJF-TRADE-2026-09-29-IN-01#3"
            ]
          },
          {
            "text": "Tash Elwyn, President of the Private Client Group, said Raymond James is committed to being a destination for private wealth advisors and that individuals and families with significant wealth require truly personal advice backed by the right resources.",
            "quote": "At Raymond James, we're committed to being a destination for private wealth advisors and the clients they serve. Individuals and families with significant wealth require truly personal advice, backed by the right resources, to navigate their financial opportunities and complexities",
            "value": "",
            "unit": "",
            "period": "",
            "scope": "",
            "definition": "",
            "chunk_ids": [
              "RJF-TRADE-2026-09-29-WM-01#0",
              "RJF-TRADE-2026-09-29-IN-01#1"
            ]
          },
          {
            "text": "Raymond James said its Private Wealth Guided Portfolios are a risk-based model framework for advisors serving high-net-worth and ultra-high-net-worth clients.",
            "quote": "introduced Private Wealth Guided Portfolios, which integrate traditional and alternative investments within risk-based portfolios for financial advisors serving high-net-worth and ultra-high-net-worth clients",
            "value": "",
            "unit": "",
            "period": "",
            "scope": "",
            "definition": "",
            "chunk_ids": [
              "RJF-TRADE-2026-09-29-WM-01#0"
            ]
          },
          {
            "text": "Raymond James said its RIA & Custody Services division brings the firm's best thinking to high-net-worth and ultra-high-net-worth clients through its Wealth Strategies offering.",
            "quote": "Wealth Strategies: Bring the best of our firm to your high-net-worth and ultra-high-net-worth clients",
            "value": "",
            "unit": "",
            "period": "",
            "scope": "RIA & Custody Services division",
            "definition": "",
            "chunk_ids": [
              "RJF-PR-web-independent-ria-custody-services#2"
            ]
          },
          {
            "text": "Per a trade press account, Raymond James' Private Wealth Advisor designation program serves advisors who specialize in high-net-worth clients, defined as those with at least $5 million in investable assets, with nearly 450 advisors earning the designation as of September 2026.",
            "quote": "a peer network for advisors who specialize in high-net-worth clients - generally defined as those with at least $5 million in investable assets. As of September 2026, nearly 450 advisors have earned the designation",
            "value": "",
            "unit": "",
            "period": "",
